msgid "EasyMesh onboarding"
msgstr "EasyMesh 入网引导"

msgid "Onboarding joins an agent to the mesh. Use WPS for a quick setup or DPP for a secure QR-code based setup."
msgstr "入网引导用于将代理节点加入 Mesh。快速配置可使用 WPS，安全配置可使用 DPP 二维码方式。"

msgid "WPS push button"
msgstr "WPS 按钮"

msgid "Start WPS on both the controller and the agent. The agent scans 5 GHz first, keep at least one non-hidden 2.4 GHz or 5 GHz fronthaul BSS for WPS."
msgstr "在控制器和代理节点上同时启动 WPS。代理节点会优先扫描 5 GHz，请至少保留一个非隐藏的 2.4 GHz 或 5 GHz 前传 BSS 用于 WPS。"

msgid "Start WPS push button"
msgstr "启动 WPS 按钮"

msgid "DPP (Wi-Fi Easy Connect)"
msgstr "DPP（Wi-Fi Easy Connect）"

msgid "DPP requires MAP version R3. On the agent press \"Retrieve DPP URI\", then paste that URI on the controller and press \"Add DPP URI & start\". Multiple URIs can be added one after another."
msgstr "DPP 需要 MAP R3 版本。在代理节点上点击“获取 DPP URI”，然后将该 URI 粘贴到控制器上并点击“添加 DPP URI 并启动”。可以依次添加多个 URI。"

msgid "DPP presence band"
msgstr "DPP 存在通告频段"

msgid "5 GHz first"
msgstr "优先 5 GHz"

msgid "2.4 GHz first"
msgstr "优先 2.4 GHz"

msgid "Band on which DPP presence announcements are sent. Takes effect after a restart."
msgstr "发送 DPP 存在通告所使用的频段。重启后生效。"

msgid "DPP URI"
msgstr "DPP URI"

