msgstr "意外的响应"

msgid "Connected Clients"
msgstr "已连接客户端"

msgid "All clients currently associated to the EasyMesh network. Signal bars reflect RSSI. Rates show RX/TX in Mbps. This list refreshes automatically every 10 seconds."
msgstr "当前连接到 EasyMesh 网络的所有客户端。信号条反映 RSSI，速率为 RX/TX（Mbps）。列表每 10 秒自动刷新。"

