msgstr "禁用"

msgid "MAP Turnkey"
msgstr "MAP Turnkey"

msgid "BS 2.0"
msgstr "BS 2.0（独立频段引导）"

msgid "API Mode"
msgstr "API 模式"

msgid "Cert"
msgstr "Cert 认证模式"

msgid "Driver MapMode. 1 = EasyMesh/MAP Turnkey, 2 = Standalone Band Steering (BS 2.0), 3 = API Mode, 4 = Cert. Requires driver reload / reboot."
msgstr "驱动 MapMode。1 = EasyMesh/MAP Turnkey，2 = 独立频段引导（BS 2.0），3 = API 模式，4 = Cert 认证模式。需要重载驱动或重启设备。"

msgid "SR Mesh Uplink Mode"
msgstr "Mesh 上行链路空间复用模式"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Only used when CFG_SUPPORT_FALCON_SR is enabled."
msgstr "仅在启用 CFG_SUPPORT_FALCON_SR 时有效。"

msgid "MAP statistics"
msgstr "MAP 统计"

msgid "Only used when EM_PLUS_SUPPORT is enabled."
msgstr "仅在启用 EM_PLUS_SUPPORT 时有效。"

msgid "Accept 3-address MAP frames"
msgstr "接受 3 地址 MAP 帧"

msgid "Only used when CONFIG_MAP_3ADDR_SUPPORT is enabled."
msgstr "仅在启用 CONFIG_MAP_3ADDR_SUPPORT 时有效。"

msgid "MAP load balance"
msgstr "MAP 负载均衡"

msgid "Driver MAP balance flag."
msgstr "驱动 MAP 负载均衡标志。"

msgid "Spatial Reuse"
msgstr "空间复用"

msgid "Enable Wi-Fi 6 Spatial Reuse. 0 = no SR, 1 = enable SR. Currently verified only on AX4200 Panther platform."
msgstr "启用 Wi-Fi 6 空间复用。0 = 不启用，1 = 启用。目前仅在 AX4200 Panther 平台验证过。"

msgid "Spatial Reuse mode"
msgstr "空间复用模式"

msgid "Single AP Mode"
msgstr "单 AP 模式"

msgid "Mesh Mode"
msgstr "Mesh 模式"

msgid "0 = SR in Single AP Mode, 1 = SR in Mesh Mode."
msgstr "0 = 单 AP 模式 SR，1 = Mesh 模式 SR。"

msgid "Dynamic OBSS PD"
msgstr "动态 OBSS PD"

msgid "Enable Dynamic OBSS PD to increase SR reuse range stronger than the ED threshold."
msgstr "启用动态 OBSS PD，使 SR 复用范围强于 ED 阈值。"

msgid "MLO/MLD Configuration"
msgstr "MLO/MLD 配置"

msgid "Configure MLO/MLD for 802.11be Multi-Link Devices (MLD). Multi-link group IDs range from 1 to 16, single-link group IDs from 17 to 48. All BSSes in the same MLD group must share the same SSID, password and security settings."
msgstr "为 802.11be 多链路设备（MLD）配置 MLO/MLD。多链路组 ID 范围为 1~16，单链路组 ID 范围为 17~48。同一 MLD 组内所有 BSS 必须使用相同的 SSID、密码与安全配置。"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "其它"

msgid "Radio"
msgstr "射频"

msgid "MLO Settings"
msgstr "MLO 设置"

msgid "Global MLD Settings"
msgstr "全局 MLD 设置"

msgid "Enable MLD"
msgstr "启用 MLD"

msgid "Enable Multi-Link Operation for this device. Only supported on 802.11be (Wi-Fi 7) SKUs."
msgstr "为本设备启用多链路操作（MLO）。仅 802.11be（Wi-Fi 7）平台支持。"

msgid "AP MLD Groups"
msgstr "AP MLD 组"

msgid "Add AP MLD Configuration"
msgstr "添加 AP MLD 配置"

msgid "Each entry defines one AP MLD group. Interfaces selected in the same group are affiliated to the same AP MLD. SSID, password and security settings must match for all interfaces in a group."
msgstr "每个条目定义一个 AP MLD 组。被选入同一组的接口会绑定到同一个 AP MLD。同一组内所有接口的 SSID、密码与安全配置必须一致。"

msgid "APCLI MLD Groups (STA)"
msgstr "APCLI MLD 组（STA）"

msgid "Add APCLI MLD Configuration"
msgstr "添加 APCLI MLD 配置"

msgid "Each entry defines one APCLI MLD group used for the wireless backhaul STA (bSTA). After creating the STA MLD, authentication, association and EAPOL handshakes happen only on the primary link, but data can be transferred on all links."
msgstr "每个条目定义一个用于无线回传 STA（bSTA）的 APCLI MLD 组。创建 STA MLD 后，认证、关联与 EAPOL 握手仅在主链路上进行，但数据可以在所有链路上传输。"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "SSID"
msgstr "SSID"

msgid "Interface list"
msgstr "接口列表"

msgid "Select the interfaces that belong to this AP MLD group. An interface can only join one MLD group."
msgstr "选择属于该 AP MLD 组的接口。每个接口只能加入一个 MLD 组。"

msgid "Select the APCLI interfaces that belong to this STA MLD group. An interface can only join one MLD group."
msgstr "选择属于该 STA MLD 组的 APCLI 接口。每个接口只能加入一个 MLD 组。"

msgid "No wireless interface found"
msgstr "未找到无线接口"

msgid "Address"
msgstr "地址"

msgid "Optional MLD MAC address. Leave empty for automatic assignment."
msgstr "可选的 MLD MAC 地址。留空则自动分配。"

msgid "Auth Mode"
msgstr "认证模式"

msgid "Enhanced Open"
msgstr "增强开放（Enhanced Open）"

msgid "WPA2-PSK"
msgstr "WPA2-PSK"

msgid "WPA3-SAE"
msgstr "WPA3-SAE"

msgid "WPA3 Transition"
msgstr "WPA3 过渡模式"

msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "加密方式"

msgid "MFPC"
msgstr "MFPC"

msgid "Management Frame Protection Capable."
msgstr "支持管理帧保护。"

msgid "MFPR"
msgstr "MFPR"

msgid "Management Frame Protection Required."
msgstr "要求管理帧保护。"

msgid "MLD group ID"
msgstr "MLD 组 ID"

msgid "Multi-link groups: 1-16, Single-link groups: 17-48."
msgstr "多链路组：1~16；单链路组：17~48。"

msgid "BSS MLD Group IDs"
msgstr "BSS 的 MLD 组 ID"

msgid "No BSS found"
msgstr "未找到 BSS"

msgid "No BSS configuration found in /etc/config/mapd."
msgstr "在 /etc/config/mapd 中未找到 BSS 配置。"

msgid "Assign each BSS to an MLD group. BSSes with the same group ID are affiliated to the same MLD. Leave empty to disable MLD for this BSS."
msgstr "为每个 BSS 分配 MLD 组。具有相同组 ID 的 BSS 会绑定到同一个 MLD。留空表示该 BSS 不启用 MLD。"

msgid "Multi-link groups: 1-16, Single-link groups: 17-48. Leave empty to disable MLD for this BSS."
msgstr "多链路组：1~16；单链路组：17~48。留空表示该 BSS 不启用 MLD。"

msgid "e.g. 1"
msgstr "例如 1"

msgid "Network Optimization for MLD"
msgstr "MLD 网络优化"

msgid "Use user BH priority in network optimization"
msgstr "在网络优化中使用用户设置的回传优先级"

msgid "When enabled, network optimization gives preference to the BH priorities set by the user."
msgstr "启用后，网络优化会优先考虑用户设置的回传优先级。"

msgid "MLD BH priority override"
msgstr "MLD 回传优先级覆盖"

msgid "Set to 1 in MLD controller to let network optimization choose the best primary backhaul for each MLD agent."
msgstr "在 MLD 控制器中设为 1，让网络优化为每个 MLD 代理选择最佳主回传。"

msgid "Behavior & Limitations"
msgstr "行为与限制"

msgid "Dynamic MLD regrouping"
msgstr "MLD 动态重组"

msgid "When MLD groups are changed, hostapd is reloaded on all mesh devices, and all stations (including agents) will disconnect and reconnect."
msgstr "修改 MLD 分组后，所有 Mesh 设备上的 hostapd 会重新加载，所有站点（包括代理）都会断开并重新连接。"

msgid "Band steering for MLD clients"
msgstr "MLD 客户端频段引导"

msgid "Band steering is not supported for MLD clients. MLD clients are expected to be connected on multiple links already."
msgstr "MLD 客户端不支持频段引导。MLD 客户端通常已经建立多链路连接，切换主链路意义不大。"

msgid "Backhaul priority for MLD"
msgstr "MLD 回传优先级"

msgid "For MLO-capable SKUs, backhaul priority has no effect. All backhaul links are treated as highest priority (1). WPS registrar only provides profiles for the band on which the WPS handshake occurred."
msgstr "对于支持 MLO 的平台，回传优先级无效。所有回传链路均视为最高优先级（1）。WPS registrar 只提供 WPS 握手所在频段的 profiles。"

msgid "MLD scan and link selection"
msgstr "MLD 扫描与链路选择"

msgid "For MLO-capable SKUs, scanning is performed on 5G, 6G and 2.4G with equal priority. Best AP score combines individual band scores and cumulative MLD score (X+Y+Z). The primary link is preferably formed on 6G to avoid DFS interruptions."
msgstr "对于支持 MLO 的平台，扫描在 5G、6G、2.4G 上等优先级进行。最佳 AP 评分结合各频段个人评分与累计 MLD 评分（X+Y+Z）。主链路优先形成在 6G，以避免 DFS 中断。"

msgid "Divergent channel planning"
msgstr "分离信道规划"

msgid "Divergent channel planning is not supported when the mesh network contains MLD devices, because all links of an MLD must operate on the same channel."
msgstr "当 Mesh 网络中存在 MLD 设备时，不支持分离信道规划，因为 MLD 的所有链路必须在同一信道上工作。"

msgid "WTS / UCI configuration"
msgstr "WTS / UCI 配置"

msgid "In wts_bss_info_config, add the MLD Group ID column at the end. All BSSes in the same MLD group must share the same SSID, password, auth mode and encryption type. In UCI, set <code>option mld_groupID '1'</code> in the corresponding interface section."
msgstr "在 wts_bss_info_config 末尾添加 MLD Group ID 列。同一 MLD 组内所有 BSS 必须使用相同的 SSID、密码、认证模式与加密方式。在 UCI 中，在对应接口 section 设置 <code>option mld_groupID '1'</code>。"

msgid "Debug"
msgstr "调试"

msgid "Runtime MLD information"
msgstr "运行时 MLD 信息"

msgid "To check the current MLD grouping at runtime, use the following command on the device console:"
msgstr "如需查看设备当前实际的 MLD 分组，请在设备控制台执行以下命令："

msgid "MLD CLI commands"
msgstr "MLD CLI 命令"

msgid "Useful commands for MLD debugging:"
msgstr "用于 MLD 调试的常用命令："
